# User guide assets: English files are copied here from docs/ at build time (preBuild) —
# derived, ignored. The German files are in-app-only generated originals (not in docs/,
# not on GitHub) and ARE committed so builds stay reproducible without running the skill.
/app/src/main/assets/user-guide/*
!/app/src/main/assets/user-guide/*-de.md
!/app/src/main/assets/user-guide/*-de.png
